{"sections":[{"slug":"导出函子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"导出函子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出函子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"导出函子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">导出函子是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的左正合或右正合函子</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">根据</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的泛性质诱导的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的函子</span> $\\mathsf{D}(\\mathcal A) \\to \\mathsf{D}(\\mathcal B)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">传统的导出函子是导出范畴之间的函子再复合同伦群函子</span> $\\mathsf{D}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">回到原来的范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体截面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体截面</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/导出前推","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出前推</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/导出张量积","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出张量积</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}